					"speakerTitle": "蒂玛乌斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 200390102,
					"content": "古代的炼金术真是奇妙…真希望能让更多人了解。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200390103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蒂玛乌斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 200390103,
					"content": "嗯？你也对炼金术感兴趣吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
